  m_Name: Extrusion Amount Calculation (Amplify Shader Editor)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: AmplifyShaderEditor::AmplifyShaderEditor.AmplifyShaderFunction
  m_functionInfo: "// Made with Amplify Shader Editor v1.9.9.15\n// Available at the Unity Asset Store - http://u3d.as/y3X \n/*ASEBEGIN\nVersion=19915\n{\"type\":\"AmplifyShaderEditor.SimpleAddOpNode, AmplifyShaderEditor\",\"id\":4,\"pos\":[-928,-256],\"params\":[\"Inherit\",\"True\",\"2\",\"2\",\"0\",\"FLOAT\",\"0\",\"False\",\"1\",\"FLOAT\",\"0\",\"False\",\"1\",\"FLOAT\",\"0\"]}\n{\"type\":\"AmplifyShaderEditor.FunctionInput, AmplifyShaderEditor\",\"id\":8,\"pos\":[-1152,-256],\"params\":[\"Inherit\",\"True\",\"Size\",\"1\",\"0\",\"False\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"False\",\"1\",\"0\",\"FLOAT\",\"0\",\"False\",\"1\",\"FLOAT\",\"0\"]}\n{\"type\":\"AmplifyShaderEditor.FunctionInput, AmplifyShaderEditor\",\"id\":9,\"pos\":[-1216,0],\"params\":[\"Inherit\",\"True\",\"Extrusion Amount\",\"1\",\"1\",\"False\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"False\",\"1\",\"0\",\"FLOAT\",\"0\",\"False\",\"1\",\"FLOAT\",\"0\"]}\n{\"type\":\"AmplifyShaderEditor.SimpleMultiplyOpNode, AmplifyShaderEditor\",\"id\":6,\"pos\":[-928,0],\"params\":[\"Inherit\",\"True\",\"2\",\"2\",\"0\",\"FLOAT\",\"0\",\"False\",\"1\",\"FLOAT3\",\"0,0,0\",\"False\",\"1\",\"FLOAT3\",\"0\"]}\n{\"type\":\"AmplifyShaderEditor.NormalVertexDataNode, AmplifyShaderEditor\",\"id\":5,\"pos\":[-1216,256],\"params\":[\"Inherit\",\"True\",\"0\",\"5\",\"FLOAT3\",\"0\",\"FLOAT\",\"1\",\"FLOAT\",\"2\",\"FLOAT\",\"3\",\"FLOAT\",\"4\"]}\n{\"type\":\"AmplifyShaderEditor.FunctionOutput, AmplifyShaderEditor\",\"id\":0,\"pos\":[-672,-256],\"params\":[\"Inherit\",\"True\",\"True\",\"-1\",\"Extrusion Size\",\"0\",\"False\",\"1\",\"0\",\"FLOAT\",\"0\",\"False\",\"1\",\"FLOAT\",\"0\"]}\n{\"type\":\"AmplifyShaderEditor.FunctionOutput, AmplifyShaderEditor\",\"id\":7,\"pos\":[-672,0],\"params\":[\"Inherit\",\"True\",\"False\",\"-1\",\"Extrusion Vertex Offset\",\"1\",\"False\",\"1\",\"0\",\"FLOAT3\",\"0,0,0\",\"False\",\"1\",\"FLOAT3\",\"0\"]}\n{\"wire\":[4,0,8,0]}\n{\"wire\":[4,1,9,0]}\n{\"wire\":[6,0,9,0]}\n{\"wire\":[6,1,5,0]}\n{\"wire\":[0,0,4,0]}\n{\"wire\":[7,0,6,0]}\nASEEND*/\n//CHKSM=FA252F2EEFA38E57A22EA2B33C10A854E0C89149"
  m_functionName: 
  m_description: 'Calculates vertex extrusion amount and vertex offset based on mesh normals.



    This function is designed to be used with Tessellation-enabled shaders only.

    It outputs both a scalar extrusion size and a vector vertex offset, allowing

    consistent geometric expansion along vertex normals.'
